| `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.inside_env` | list of strings | `slurm` gets `["SLURM_JOB_ID"]` | environment variable names, each once | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `main` | Names the variables whose presence means the launcher already runs inside a job of this farm, so it runs here and never submits a job of its own. | the variables a job receives: `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.env` | always |
